{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39526","headline":"投翰林张侍郎 · 张蠙","name":"投翰林张侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"举家贫拾海边樵，来认仙宗在碧霄。\n丹穴虽无凡羽翼，灵椿还向细枝条。\n九衢马识他门少，十载身辞故国遥。\n愿与吾君作霖雨，且应平地活枯苗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张蠙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39526.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39526","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}